<title>USA: TABLE-WOOLWORTH JULY SAME-STORE SALES DOWN.</title>
<headline>TABLE-WOOLWORTH JULY SAME-STORE SALES DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>			    1997    1996     Total   Same-store</p>
<p> Month		$    467 $   508	-7.9     -5.8</p>
<p> Year-to-date	  3,055   3,126	-2.3     -2.3</p>
<p>(Figures in millions, except percentages)</p>
<p>Month is four-weeks ended August 2, 1997.</p>
<p>Year-to-date is 26 weeks ended August 2, 1997.</p>
<p>Sales of domestic general merchandise operations, popularly known as five and dime stores, have been excluded from all periods reported in connection with planned store closings.</p>
<p>Full company name is Woolworth Corp.</p>
